%% draw-visual:
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant P0 as Script
  participant P1 as Event queue
  participant P2 as Decisions
  participant P3 as Sim store
  participant P4 as Checks+trace
  P0->>P1: register R1, P
  P1->>P2: deliver register
  P2->>P3: effect: reserve
  Note over P3: commit R1
  P3->>P1: completion: committed
  P1->>P2: deliver committed
  P2->>P3: effect: reply
  P0->>P3: fault: lose that reply
  P0->>P1: retry R1, P
  P1->>P2: deliver retry
  P2->>P3: effect: look up
  P3->>P1: completion: found, P matches
  P1->>P2: deliver found
  Note over P2: decide: same identity
  Note over P0,P4: scripted restart: memory discarded, committed records kept
  Note over P2: rebuild from committed records
  P0->>P1: inspect a
  P1->>P2: deliver inspect
  P0->>P1: register R1, P2
  P1->>P2: deliver R1, P2
  Note over P2: decide: conflict
  P2->>P4: state + effects
  Note over P4: one identity? P unchanged?
  Note over P4: write trace for replay
